nce of squares formula:\n\n$$\na^2-b^2 = (a+b)(a-b)\n$$\n\nWe can use this formula to factor the difference of two squared monomials.\n\nFor example, suppose that we want to factor the expression\n\n$$\nx^2 - 4\n$$\n\nThis expression is a difference of squares:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx^{2} - 4 &=  \\\\\n&= x^{2} - 2^{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can factor the expression using the difference of squares formula with $a=x$ and $b=2$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx^{2} - 4 &=  \\\\\nx^{2} - 2^{2} &=  \\\\\n&= (x + 2)(x - 2)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065342 #edb/ref 1065 1599 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065342 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "3f50b677-50fc-5584-82de-7ad393d19d72" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065342 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068678 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048187 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068678 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048868 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068678 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069295 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068678 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069296 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068678 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding the Length of the Hypotenuse of a Given Right Triangle" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068678 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186068539 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068678 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "b6db510b-5976-5c90-8e02-b9f61ff3327b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069428 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069429 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186459302 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186480701 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186487374 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186489178 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186491172 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068679